<view class="report-page">
  <text class="eyebrow">为您家的报告 · 第 {{step + 1}} / 5 步</text><view class="step-track"><view wx:for="{{titles}}" wx:key="index" class="step-dot {{index <= step ? 'active' : ''}}" /></view><text class="page-title">{{titles[step]}}</text><text class="body">不了解的现场条件留待核实，不替您猜测。</text>
  <view class="card form" wx:if="{{step === 0}}"><text class="label">建房地区</text><picker mode="region" bindchange="region"><view class="input">{{input.site.region || '选择省 / 市 / 区县'}}</view></picker><text class="label">宅基地面宽（米）</text><input class="input" type="digit" value="{{input.site.width_m || ''}}" data-field="site.width_m" bindinput="field" placeholder="填写 4–50 米，例如 12" /><text class="label">宅基地进深（米）</text><input class="input" type="digit" value="{{input.site.depth_m || ''}}" data-field="site.depth_m" bindinput="field" placeholder="填写 4–80 米，例如 10" /><text class="caption">填大致尺寸即可；可建边界、朝向、临路与审批条件需要后续核实。</text></view>
  <view class="card form" wx:elif="{{step === 1}}"><text class="label">家庭类型</text><view class="choices"><button wx:for="{{families}}" wx:key="*this" class="choice {{input.household.family_type === item ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-field="household.family_type" data-value="{{item}}" bindtap="choice">{{item}}</button></view><text class="label">哪些人常住？是否有老人、孩子？</text><textarea class="input textarea" maxlength="80" value="{{input.household.residents}}" data-field="household.residents" bindinput="field" placeholder="例如：夫妻、两个孩子，父母长期同住" /></view>
  <view class="card form" wx:elif="{{step === 2}}"><text class="label">计划建几层？</text><view class="choices"><button wx:for="{{floors}}" wx:key="*this" class="choice {{input.space.floors === item ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-field="space.floors" data-value="{{item}}" bindtap="choice">{{item}} 层</button></view><text class="label">希望有几间卧室？</text><input class="input" type="number" value="{{input.space.bedrooms || ''}}" data-field="space.bedrooms" bindinput="field" placeholder="填写 1–12 间" /><view class="switch-row"><text>一层需要长辈卧室</text><switch checked="{{input.space.first_floor_elder_room}}" color="#9f7957" bindchange="elder" /></view><text class="caption">计划层数不是审批结论；报告不会把未经核实的条件当作已获批准。</text></view>
  <view class="card form" wx:elif="{{step === 3}}"><text class="label">更喜欢哪种建筑风格？</text><view class="choices"><button wx:for="{{styles}}" wx:key="*this" class="choice {{input.preference.style === item ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-field="preference.style" data-value="{{item}}" bindtap="choice">{{item}}</button></view><text class="label">最在意的三件事</text><text class="caption">按重要性依次选择，先选的排在前面。</text><checkbox-group bindchange="priorities"><label class="check-row" wx:for="{{priorityChoices}}" wx:key="label"><checkbox value="{{item.label}}" checked="{{item.checked}}" color="#9f7957" />{{item.label}}</label></checkbox-group><text class="label">您希望建成怎样的家？</text><textarea class="input textarea" maxlength="80" value="{{input.preference.goal}}" data-field="preference.goal" bindinput="field" placeholder="例如：让父母不用爬楼，节假日一家人住得下" /></view>
  <view class="card form" wx:else><text class="label">总预算（万元）</text><input class="input" type="digit" value="{{input.budget.wan || ''}}" data-field="budget.wan" bindinput="field" placeholder="填写 10–1000 万元" /><text class="label">这笔钱需要包含</text><view class="choices"><button wx:for="{{scopes}}" wx:key="*this" class="choice {{input.budget.scope === item ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-field="budget.scope" data-value="{{item}}" bindtap="choice">{{item}}</button></view><view class="divider" /><text class="item-title">核对您的建房计划</text><text class="body">{{input.site.region}} · {{input.site.width_m}} × {{input.site.depth_m}} 米
{{input.household.family_type}} · {{input.space.floors}} 层 · {{input.space.bedrooms}} 间卧室
{{input.preference.style}} · {{input.preference.goal}}</text><checkbox-group bindchange="consent"><label class="check-row"><checkbox value="agree" checked="{{consent}}" color="#9f7957" /><text>同意使用以上信息生成报告。我了解这是前期概念建议，不是施工或审批依据。</text></label></checkbox-group><text class="caption">无需上传身份证、产权证明或精确门牌地址。</text></view>
  <text class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</text><button class="primary" bindtap="next" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">{{nextLabel}}</button><button wx:if="{{step > 0}}" class="secondary" bindtap="previous" disabled="{{busy}}">返回上一步</button>
</view>
